hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16032","Abu Salamah al-Khuzai narrated to us, he said, Abu Hilal informed us, from Humayd ibn Hilal al-Adawi, he heard it from him, from Abu Qatadah, from the Bedouin who heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saying: The best of your religion is its easiest, the best of your religion is its easiest."
